//! Batched multi-iteration WebGPU Mandelbrot chunk prover.
//!
//! Specializes the production 428-column BabyBear AIR, 708-constraint
//! composition polynomial, Poseidon2 Merkle commitments, and degree-bounded
//! FRI schedule to arbitrary power-of-two chunk sizes (`T in {16, 64, 256, 1024}`,
//! `L = 4 * T in {64, 256, 1024, 4096}`, `FRI_ROUNDS = log2(L) in {6, 8, 10, 12}`).
//!
//! Every Poseidon2 sponge absorption and Merkle tree compression executes in
//! per-thread registers across workgroup grids (`Threads<64, 1, 1>`) while the
//! 4-pass FRI round cycle uses `Cycle<FriRoundCycle, ..., FRI_ROUNDS>` with
//! `Taper`, keeping the entire chunk prover to 34 shader passes and a single
//! WebGPU command buffer submission (83..182 dispatches total).

